const INTRO_A=[['doug','Oga Captain, how long are we going to stand here?'],['josh','Until HQ tells us where to go, Doug. It is called waiting. Soldiers do it.'],['doug','Soldiers do it standing. I am sitting. It is called being strategic.'],['josh','You are sitting on my radio case.'],['doug','It is a very comfortable case.'],['josh','Doug. Focus. Do you know why we were sent to this part of Kijuju?'],['doug','Because the BSAA loves sending me to places with no snacks.'],['josh','Because the intel says Jill Valentine may be nearby.'],['doug','Jill Valentine. Say it again. Slower.'],['josh','Doug.'],['doug','I just like how it sounds.'],['josh','You know she survived the Spencer Mansion, right? 1998. STARS Alpha Team.'],['doug','The master of unlocking. Barry gave her a lockpick and called her the master of unlocking.'],['josh','And you know what else Barry said?'],['doug','The Jill sandwich! He said, you were almost a Jill sandwich! Josh, that is the greatest thing anyone has ever said.'],['josh','It was a rescue, Doug. A very close one. The ceiling was coming down.'],['doug','And she just stood there. Calm. Like a sandwich with great posture.'],['josh','She trusted Captain Wesker. And Wesker turned out to be the villain all along.'],['doug','The sunglasses were a red flag. Never trust a man who can see in the dark.'],['josh','Then September 1998. Raccoon City. Her second nightmare.'],['doug','Nemesis! The big guy in the coat! He kept saying STARS. Over and over. Like a bad radio.'],['josh','She outran him through a whole dying city. Doug, I could not outrun you on a good day.'],['doug','Because I stop for snacks.'],['josh','She also met Carlos Oliveira. A mercenary. He was not bad.'],['doug','He was not bad at all. I checked. Tall. Good posture. A real man, with a real beard.'],['josh','Meanwhile you have a helmet and a dream.'],['doug','And a helicopter. I have a helicopter.'],['josh','Which is parked. Somewhere. Far from here.'],['doug','Beautifully parked. Do not bring it up.'],['josh','And then 2009. Wesker finds her. Puts the P30 device on her chest. Makes her fight Chris.'],['doug','Chris. Chris with the boulder-punching arms. She fought that man and lived.'],['josh','Chris and Sheva freed her. Eventually.'],['doug','Sheva. Your little sister of the team. How is she?'],['josh','She beats me at cards, Doug. She is fine.'],['doug','I have heard they say, in some timeline, we find her in Wesker’s facility, and I flirt over the radio, and then a missile gets me.'],['josh','Stop reading ahead, Doug.'],['doug','I am only saying, I want a good ending.'],['doug','Between you and me, Captain. Honestly. Who has a better chance with Jill? Me or you?'],['josh','Doug. I am a Captain. I have a rank, a radio, and a title longer than this street.'],['doug','I have charm.'],['josh','Charm is not a rank.'],['doug','Rank is not a personality.'],['josh','Fine. Let us do this properly. Qualification one. Height.'],['doug','Josh. You are very tall. I will give you that.'],['josh','Qualification two. Courage.'],['doug','I jumped out of a helicopter once!'],['josh','It was parked, Doug.'],['doug','It was parked at a great height.'],['josh','Qualification three. Poetry.'],['doug','Roses are red. Missiles are red. Jill is... a person.'],['josh','That is the worst poem I have ever heard.'],['doug','She will love it.'],['josh','Meanwhile Chris will punch a boulder in her honor and she will say yes.'],['doug','Chris always gets the girl, Josh. We are just the supporting cast.'],['josh','Speak for yourself. I am the Captain.'],['doug','Captain of what? The radio?'],['josh','Of Delta Team. West Africa Branch. Captain Josh Stone, Decorated Member of the Bioterrorism Security Assessment Alliance...'],['doug','Here we go.'],['josh','...West Africa Branch, Commander of Several People Who Asked Not to Be Commanded, Handler of Helicopters Piloted by Doug.'],['doug','Okay, that last part is accurate.']],
INTRO_B=[['doug','Josh. Do you hear that?'],['josh','That is thunder.'],['doug','It is a clear day.'],['josh','Then it is your stomach.'],['doug','My stomach does not whistle.']],
INTRO_C=[['doug','Josh. Why is that missile curving?'],['josh','Missiles do not curve.'],['doug','This one has my name on it.'],['josh','Doug, it does not have your... Doug, it is looking at you.'],['doug','I TOLD YOU!'],['josh','MOVE! DOUG, MOVE! NOW!']],
INTRO_D=[['josh','Doug! Doug, are you alive?'],['doug','I think my hair is gone. And my dignity. Mostly my hair.'],['josh','That was a Doug-seeking missile, Doug. Somebody is hunting you.'],['doug','Why me?! I am a pilot! I am a lover!'],['josh','We are under attack. And if they are hitting us... they are hitting Jill.'],['doug','JILL!'],['josh','Come on, Doug. We run. We protect her. You stay behind me.'],['doug','Always behind you, Oga Captain. Always.']];
