h+=H('DELETED SCENES');del.forEach(t=>h+=P(t));h+=H('EVEN MORE MEMORIES');eul.slice(28).forEach(t=>h+=P(t));h+=H('WESKER SUNGLASSES REPORT');['The sunglasses were present at all times.','The sunglasses were present indoors.','The sunglasses were present in the volcano.','The sunglasses were present when he fell in the volcano. They survived. They were not even warm.','Wesker was asked to remove his sunglasses for a scene. He declined. The scene was cut.','Wesker says the sunglasses are not a personality. The sunglasses disagree.','The sunglasses were not harmed in the making of this fight.','No Dougs were harmed after the credits. Doug was harmed during the credits.'].forEach(t=>h+=P(t));h+=H('SPECIAL THANKS');thanks.forEach(t=>h+=P(t));
